<div class="step-indicator" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px;">
  <span class="tape-badge" style="background: #1f1f23; color: #888; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">📡 FILA OFFLINE</span>
</div>

<h2 class="screen-title" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">Aguardando conexão</h2>
<p class="screen-desc" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  Você está sem internet. Salvamos seu treino localmente e enviaremos assim que você voltar ao sinal. Fique tranquilo, seu progresso não vai sumir.
</p>

<div class="sub-headline-card" style="position: relative; background: #1a1b20; border: 1px solid #343538; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 14px; transform: none; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #121316;">
  <div class="version-badge" style="position: absolute; top: -8px; right: -6px; background: #ffb800; color: black; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; padding: 3px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">STATUS: NA FILA</div>
  
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid #343538; background: #121316; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 24px; color: #666;">cloud_off</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
      <span style="font-size: 10px; color: #9e8f78; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold;">AGUARDANDO</span>
      <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #e3e2e6; margin: 0;">1 item na fila</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding-top: 20px;">
  <%= button_to submit_training_session_path(@training_session), method: :patch, class: "tactile-btn-primary", style: "width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; background: #343538; color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #121316;" do %>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">sync</span>
    <span style="font-weight: 800;">Tentar enviar agora</span>
  <% end %>
  
  <%= link_to track_path, class: "secondary-link-btn", style: "text-align: center; display: block;" do %>
    Voltar para a trilha
  <% end %>
</div>
